| :--- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |
| g1 | 1 | -0.1840 | -0.9796 | 0.1878 | 0.1878 |
| g2 | 2 | -0.7068 | -2.2349 | 0.3163 | 0.3163 |
| g3 | 4 | 0.4024 | 0.8374 | 0.4805 | 0.4805 |
| g4 | 8 | 0.9200 | 1.4173 | 0.6491 | 0.6491 |
